{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"hyperbolic-pernicious-drongo","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"Cut the next minor release (0.12.0 -> 0.13.0) following docs/releasing.md:\n1. Bump version in pyproject.toml, server.json (top-level + packages[].version), promote CHANGELOG.md [Unreleased] -> [0.13.0], land through Gerrit.\n2. Dispatch release.yml from main with version=0.13.0, approve pending pypi deployment.\n3. Verify Homebrew autobump + MCP registry publish (both automated) and run post-release smoke checks.\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- pyproject.toml/server.json/CHANGELOG.md version-lockstep landed on main via Gerrit (LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, submitted).\n- release.yml workflow_dispatch run from main succeeds and publishes nava-rebar 0.13.0 to PyPI (verified via PyPI JSON API).\n- GitHub Release v0.13.0 created automatically with sdist+wheel attached.\n- Homebrew tap and MCP registry reflect 0.13.0 (or scheduled automation confirmed to pick it up).","id":"c066-c496-7012-4a39","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Release rebar 0.13.0"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1787937730531735504,"uuid":"6eee7973-0175-42c6-b150-489728a21a72"}